WEBVTT

00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:14,970
By Ayurvedic doctor tested all my supplements via electrodermal testing, how does this compare

00:00:14,970 --> 00:00:15,970
to conhesiology?

00:00:15,970 --> 00:00:18,490
Well, it's just different.

00:00:18,490 --> 00:00:25,170
So electrodermal test is if you put your hand on a cradle and you test a supplement and

00:00:25,170 --> 00:00:34,170
it can test positive or negative for you and it's just a different way to test with conhesiology.

00:00:35,170 --> 00:00:48,170
With my conhesiology I lock into your body, then lock into cancer and we're tested against cancer, we're not testing the supplements just, you know, in random.

00:00:48,170 --> 00:00:51,170
So it's tested against your cancer.

00:00:51,170 --> 00:00:54,170
So that's the difference on how we do conhesiology.

00:00:54,170 --> 00:01:00,170
That being said, there's all sorts of different practitioners that do conhesiology that.

00:01:00,170 --> 00:01:08,170
It's just personally, I wouldn't trust, so I mean, it isn't art form that you have to trust the person doing it.

00:01:08,170 --> 00:01:15,170
I would have the 35 supplements that I'm taking, he said my body only responded well to four.

00:01:15,170 --> 00:01:17,170
And I should only take those four.

00:01:17,170 --> 00:01:23,170
So what should I do? I really don't know what to do since I purchased all these supplements already.

00:01:23,170 --> 00:01:33,170
Again, I'm not ever telling anybody here that you got to do it my way or, you know, you got to make that decision of what you got to do.

00:01:33,170 --> 00:01:39,170
You, you trusted me to test you and it came back the testing that came back.

00:01:39,170 --> 00:01:47,170
And you're going to somebody else to test you too, then you got to just decide what you want to do.

00:01:47,170 --> 00:01:55,170
So I can't tell you, no, you need to do this, you know, your body knows if you need to make that decision.

00:01:55,170 --> 00:02:02,170
If that practitioner is being kind of, you know, arrogant and say, this is all you should be doing.

00:02:02,170 --> 00:02:04,170
You should be doing well, then you got to make that decision.

00:02:04,170 --> 00:02:08,170
I can't, I'm not going to get into an argument between practitioner.

00:02:08,170 --> 00:02:10,170
So you decide what you want to do.

